    "attribution": "Data relating to a time less than 1 hour ago and the future: Google WeatherNext 3, \u00a9 2024-6 Google LLC, whose machine learning models were used to create the experimental data made available under the following licence terms https://storage.googleapis.com/weathernext-public/terms-of-use.pdf. This data is intended for experimental modelling only and is not intended, validated, or approved for real world use. Data relating to a time 1 hour ago or more: \u00a9 2026 DeepMind Technologies Limited's machine learning models used to create the experimental data made available at https://developers.google.com/earth-engine/datasets/catalog/projects_gcp-public-data-weathernext_assets_weathernext_3_0_0_0p1deg under CC BY 4.0 licence terms. This data is intended for experimental modelling only and is not intended, validated, or approved for real world use. Use of the third-party materials referred to in the Acknowledgements section may be governed by separate terms and conditions or license provisions. Your use of the third-party materials is subject to any such terms and you should check that you can comply with any applicable restrictions or terms and conditions before use.",
